    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それって、放クラでいる時、\r\nみなさんが見せてくれるからだったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしがひとりでお仕事する時に、\r\n困らないようにって……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はなれてても、一緒にお仕事してない時でも、\r\nみなさんに守ってもらってるんだって、思いました！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから……あたしも、みなさんのために\r\n何かできるようになりたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……できること、か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は果穂がみんなのためにできてること、もうあると思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！？　ありますか……っ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nたとえばさ、放クラで合宿した時のこと、覚えてるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "みんなでカレーを作ったり、まくら投げしたり、\r\n写真をとったり……楽しかったです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900305/1009003050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう、写真！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "メンバーの写真がとても好評だったけど\r\n俺は、あれを撮ったのが果穂だからだって思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003050180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あたしだったから、ですか？",
